    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Hooman Ghomeshi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107055396429173894551/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHiesAi4yEv404LI0cXpn7FxqhLbz6OJjp6rTd7TJospQM56JY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I came to this store on Dec 30th to get some items I needed for my New year gathering the next day. I checked their holiday hours on their website and they were supposed to be open till 6:00 p.m. I got there half an hour earlier and they were already closed but were inside the store. When they saw me, a man came to open the door but refused to help me and just said they were closed. I tried to explain that I had to come from out of town and had checked their website before coming, but the man rudely closed the door in my face without listening to me. I wonder if I would have received better service if I spoke French. I have a few expensive purchases to make, but I will not be coming back here. I suggest any other English speakers or people who care about politeness and  courteous service take their business elsewhere as well.",
        "time": 1640904299,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hanna Aberin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111075347013893895804/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOKe7CioIAjg4KF6a8ZilZT1IWwco0Wmo4t2BS351BQKXb_xrh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "I purchased my patio furniture and parasol from them about 5 years ago. 2 of the screws of my parasol broke so I had to contact the store. They found my file right away and the manager (Jean-Pierre) was helpful. He directed me to bring the parasol to their warehouse in Lachine. I went to meet Eric and Greg. They fixed my parasol in under 15 minutes - free of charge! Very efficient, knowledgeable and kind people! Great customer service! Thank you, guys! :)",
        "time": 1531362307,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Claude pascal Vachon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105694412837108310800/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1IItcM3EkLUhcGfKj6Nrdi9VnFlMEFHnZPWDsO6Gr35ZaVQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Bought a small pool cue and a wall rack, the pool cue has a curve in it, but the one that was shown to me was perfect.\nthe wall rack was priced at 20$ he also told me the price. he charged me 10$ overand when I asked him why it was 10$ over he said that he did not show me the right one, yet it was on the wall right behind him? When I got home I unwraped the wall mount and its all scratched up and has a couple of dents in it. I will not be returning to these scam artist.",
        "time": 1626640444,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Frederik Delisle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103611675110446282928/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-Tcwt-gtb-LaxIz4PLqXMcr1yuGUapg-SMWu5svfQ86PPNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Worst service ever, bought a table there a year ago, installation was terrible, table was totally beat up and was supposed to be a demo but was just beat up. I had to fight with them pay the difference and finally change it for a new model, but had to comeback 2 times to fix small issue and the last time the installation guy was not able to fix it, so hey told me a supervisor will call me back.... They never did I had to send an email back 8 months after to do a follow up..... Long story short a year after today, I still try to get my table fix but say they cannot do it before Januray 2020 since my table is back order. Never go there go somewhere else !!! Worst service ever !",
        "time": 1575917844,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadine Bolduc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100977588925365385416/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVRKnMmh-q99VTpOqeJMAY0X_MmbK3zhmlrVxzQgSNlt3v3ssSgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Only recently discovered this store in Vaudreuil-Dorion after looking for kitchen counter stools. They have a great selection in-store so you can actually try if they have the look and comfort you are looking for. Many custom colour selections to be able to match your decor. Also have a large selection of gaming and patio stuff. Fun store to visit.",
        "time": 1597574301,
        "translated": false
      }
